# The three clients join, and each moves five steps right. Once all three moves are
# saved, stop the world program on purpose (K): the supervisor starts it again, the
# clients join again, and it puts each where they were. Then restart the whole server
# on the same disk, and the same happens.
expect saved player 2 at 70 100
expect saved player 3 at 70 140
expect saved player 4 at 70 20
type k
expect next started again: the world 1 time(s), the lobby 0
expect restored player 2 at 70 100
expect restored player 3 at 70 140
expect restored player 4 at 70 20
reboot
expect next world started: 3 saved players
